<!--
  Drift Host's entitlements (STORE-4): none. It is signed with Developer ID and the Hardened
  Runtime, and deliberately not sandboxed (ADR IOS-0 decision 9: it injects input into other
  apps, uses a private API for the virtual display, and later runs at the login window).

  Nothing it does needs a Hardened Runtime exception: ScreenCaptureKit (picture and system
  audio), CGEventPost and the Keychain are gated by TCC permissions (Screen Recording,
  Accessibility) that the user grants, not by entitlements; it loads no third-party libraries and
  generates no code, so library validation and JIT stay on.
-->
